  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "55d21e03-d8cd-4589-90d5-766ce97a0343"],
 ") of repeated indices that belong to the adjoint representation of the \
gauge group. To use lower case Greek letter starting from \[Alpha] we may \
specify"
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->1442350183,ExpressionUUID->"cbf325bd-c459-4345-b08c-0dffebfafd90"],

